    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel that tells a comedic story about a campus hero, and it also includes some puzzle mini-games. We hope this work will bring smiles to everyone while also raising awareness about the importance of standing up against school bullying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Lu Yunjie, a middle school student who accidentally witnesses his classmate Ling Yu being bullied. He decisively steps in to help. Although Ling Yu escapes, Lu Yunjie becomes a target of the bullying group. In a critical moment when he is caught, by a stroke of luck, he unintentionally gains a special superpower. With this newfound ability, Lu Yunjie embarks on a journey to fight against school bullying...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a GalGame that I and my two high school friends challenged ourselves to create within one month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game development process and records can be viewed on the following platforms:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili:\u6211\u662f\u767d\u6797\u90b1<br>Douyin:\u6211\u7cfb\u767d\u6797\u90b1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Thank you all very much for your support!</u></i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel that tells a comedic story about a campus hero, and it also includes some puzzle mini-games. We hope this work will bring smiles to everyone while also raising awareness about the importance of standing up against school bullying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Lu Yunjie, a middle school student who accidentally witnesses his classmate Ling Yu being bullied. He decisively steps in to help. Although Ling Yu escapes, Lu Yunjie becomes a target of the bullying group. In a critical moment when he is caught, by a stroke of luck, he unintentionally gains a special superpower. With this newfound ability, Lu Yunjie embarks on a journey to fight against school bullying...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a GalGame that I and my two high school friends challenged ourselves to create within one month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game development process and records can be viewed on the following platforms:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili:\u6211\u662f\u767d\u6797\u90b1<br>Douyin:\u6211\u7cfb\u767d\u6797\u90b1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Thank you all very much for your support!</u></i></strong></p>",
